---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Subscribe with RSS" description="Follow teimakes posts in your feed reader with RSS or JSON Feed. No email signup is required.">
  <section class="hero"><h1>Subscribe</h1><p>Follow new posts in your favorite feed reader.</p></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Add one of these feed addresses to your reader:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>: <code>https://teimakes.github.io/rss.xml</code></li>
      <li><a href="/feed.json">JSON Feed</a>: <code>https://teimakes.github.io/feed.json</code></li>
    </ul>
    <p>The feeds include published posts in Korean and English. Your reader checks for new entries automatically.</p>
    <p>Email subscriptions are not currently available. This site does not collect email addresses.</p>
    <p lang="ko">RSS 리더에서 위 주소를 추가하면 새 글을 받아볼 수 있습니다. 현재 이메일 뉴스레터는 운영하지 않습니다.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
